From c47be25084900a705cb86938ae8f59d3e293bd3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cristian Ciocaltea <cristian.ciocaltea@collabora.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jul 2024 03:45:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] gitlab-ci: Update AMD SOF firmware blobs

The steamdeck-dsp-0.46.2-1 package contains updated firmware to fix the
audio DSP crashes occurring quite frequently in certain test scenarios,
e.g. resuming from suspend:

/usr/lib/firmware/amd/sof-tplg/sof-vangogh-nau8821-max.tplg
/usr/lib/firmware/amd/sof/sof-vangogh-code.bin
/usr/lib/firmware/amd/sof/sof-vangogh-data.bin

Recreate the firmware archive used when building the QEMU kernel config.

Signed-off-by: Cristian Ciocaltea <cristian.ciocaltea@collabora.com>
Signed-off-by: Henry Paradiz <henry.paradiz@gmail.com>
---
 ci/fw.tar.zst | Bin 3189170 -> 3189017 bytes
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

